Short:        Directory Opus 5 for the Amiga (68k)
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     spotup@gmail.com (spotUP)
Type:         util/dopus
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0
Requires:     none
Distribution: Aminet

The open-source Directory Opus 5 5.104 release builds for AmigaOS 3, unmodified, with their own
installer: the 68000 build for a 68000 or 68010, the 68020 build for a 68020 and newer. It stands
alone, and a Directory Opus that is already installed (DOpus5: assigned) is never touched.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes this archive's record; the DOpus5: drawer
stays.

